{"id": "ncre-python-sample-q031:answer:v2", "text": "第31题内部参考答案：\n(1) 0, 1；(2) a <= 100；(3) b；(4) a + b\n\n```python\na, b = 0, 1\nwhile a <= 100:\n    print(a, end=', ')\n    a, b = b, a + b\n```\n\n解析：每轮先输出当前a，再同时把(a,b)变为(b,a+b)；下一项144超过100，因此停止。按题给F(0)应包含开头0及两个1。", "metadata": {"visibility": "internal_answer", "question_id": "ncre-python-sample-q031", "document_id": "31a16a56-e947-505e-948a-a7075fd42ea0", "document_type": "sample_exam", "document_sha256": "a0f6a19967464aba6bbb5150d4311311672179c963f631eeed6745e7f4956fd8", "source_path": "python考试真题/二级Python语言程序设计——样题及参考答案.pdf", "source_title": "全国计算机等级考试（NCRE）二级 Python 语言程序设计 样题及参考答案", "exam_year": null, "question_number": 31, "section": "二、基本操作题", "question_type": "code_blank", "pdf_pages": [7], "topic_tags": ["斐波那契数列", "while", "多重赋值", "循环边界"], "difficulty": 2, "knowledge_node_ids": ["python.ch3.while", "python.ch3.parallel_assignment"], "knowledge_points": [{"id": "python.ch3.while", "name": "while 循环与边界", "role": "assessed", "is_primary": true, "chapter_id": "python_tutorial.ch03", "chapter_title": "3. Python 速览", "reference_section": "3.2", "reference_url": "https://docs.python.org/3/tutorial/introduction.html#first-steps-towards-programming", "is_supplementary": false}, {"id": "python.ch3.parallel_assignment", "name": "多重赋值与状态推进", "role": "assessed", "is_primary": false, "chapter_id": "python_tutorial.ch03", "chapter_title": "3. Python 速览", "reference_section": "3.2", "reference_url": "https://docs.python.org/3/tutorial/introduction.html#first-steps-towards-programming", "is_supplementary": false}], "annotation_origin": "project_annotation", "review_status": "approved", "retrieval_ready": true, "revision": 2, "runtime_curriculum_eligible": false, "asset_paths": ["assets/source-page-7.png"], "answer_origin": "project_annotation", "source_correct_option": null, "correct_option": null, "source_text": null, "answer_pdf_pages": [], "assumptions": [], "references": ["https://docs.python.org/3/tutorial/introductio