{"id": "ncre-python-sample-q032:answer:v2", "text": "第32题内部参考答案：\nx = (3**4 + 5 - 6*7) / 8，结果5.5。\n\n```python\nx = (3**4 + 5 - 6 * 7) / 8\nprint(x)\n```\n\n解析：视觉公式分子为3的4次方+5-6乘7，分母8。先算81+5-42=44，再算44/8=5.5。Python幂运算使用**而非^。", "metadata": {"visibility": "internal_answer", "question_id": "ncre-python-sample-q032", "document_id": "31a16a56-e947-505e-948a-a7075fd42ea0", "document_type": "sample_exam", "document_sha256": "a0f6a19967464aba6bbb5150d4311311672179c963f631eeed6745e7f4956fd8", "source_path": "python考试真题/二级Python语言程序设计——样题及参考答案.pdf", "source_title": "全国计算机等级考试（NCRE）二级 Python 语言程序设计 样题及参考答案", "exam_year": null, "question_number": 32, "section": "二、基本操作题", "question_type": "programming", "pdf_pages": [7], "topic_tags": ["数学表达式", "幂运算", "运算优先级", "Python 表达式"], "difficulty": 2, "knowledge_node_ids": ["python.ch3.arithmetic_expressions"], "knowledge_points": [{"id": "python.ch3.arithmetic_expressions", "name": "算术表达式与公式转写", "role": "assessed", "is_primary": true, "chapter_id": "python_tutorial.ch03", "chapter_title": "3. Python 速览", "reference_section": "3.1.1", "reference_url": "https://docs.python.org/3/tutorial/introduction.html#numbers", "is_supplementary": false}], "annotation_origin": "project_annotation", "review_status": "approved", "retrieval_ready": true, "revision": 2, "runtime_curriculum_eligible": false, "asset_paths": ["assets/source-page-7.png"], "answer_origin": "project_annotation", "source_correct_option": null, "correct_option": null, "source_text": null, "answer_pdf_pages": [], "assumptions": [], "references": ["https://docs.python.org/3/tutorial/introduction.html#numbers"]}}
{"id": "ncre-python-sample-q033:answer:v2", "text": "第33题内部参考答案：\n(1) for _ in range(8):；(2)     print(choice(chars), end='')\n\n```python\nchars = list('0123456789abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyzABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ')\nfrom random import choice\nfor _ in range(8):\n    print(choice(chars), end='')\n```\n\n解析：沿用原题提供的chars列表，使用choice每次抽一个字符、共抽8次；随机结果不应限定为某一个固定字符串。题干的9个数字与0至9共10个数字矛盾，本解答明确按给定字符表处理。", "metadata": {"visibility": "internal_answer", "question_id": "ncre-python-sample-q033", "document_id": "31a16a56-e947-505e-948a-a7075fd42ea0", "document_type": "sample_exam", "document_sha256": "a0f6a19967464aba6bbb5150d4311311672179c963f631eeed6745e7f4956fd8", "source_path": "python考试真题/二级Python语言程序设计——样题及参考答案.pdf", "source_title": "全国计算机等级考试（NCRE）二级 Python 语言程序设计 样题及参考答案", "exam_year": null, "question_number": 33, "section": "二、基本操作题", "question_type": "code_blank", "pdf_pages": [7, 8], "topic_tags": ["随机密码", "random.choice()", "字符串", "循环", "字符集合"], "difficulty": 3, "knowledge_node_ids": ["python.ch10.random_choice", "python.ch4.for_range"], "knowledge_points": [{"id": "python.ch10.random_choice", "name": "random.choice() 随机选择", "role": "assessed", "is_primary": true, "chapter_id": "python_tutorial.ch10", "chapter_title": "10. 标准库概览", "reference_section": "10.6", "reference_url": "https://docs.python.org/3/tutorial/stdlib.html#mathematics", "is_supplementary": false}, {"id": "python.ch4.for_range", "name": "for 与 range()", "role": "assessed", "is_primary": false, "chapter_id": "python_tutorial.ch04", "chapter_title": "4. 更多控制流工具", "reference_section": "4.2,4.3", "reference_url": "https://docs.python.org/3/tutorial/controlflow.html#for-statements", "is_supplementary": false}], "annotation_origin": "project_annotation", "review_status": "approved", "retrieval_ready": true, "revision": 2, "runtime_curriculum_eligible": false, "asset_paths": ["assets/source-page-7.png", "assets/source-page-8.png"], "answer_origin": "project_annotation", "source_correct_option": null, "corre