{"id": "ncre-python-sample-q034:answer:v2", "text": "第34题内部参考答案：\n依次设置朝向0、120、240度，每次前进200。\n\n```python\nimport turtle\nfor angle in (0, 120, 240):\n    turtle.seth(angle)\n    turtle.fd(200)\nturtle.done()\n```\n\n解析：默认standard坐标中，从左下顶点向右走200，再向120度走200到上顶点，再向240度走200回到左下顶点；与原图的向上等边三角形及终点一致。", "metadata": {"visibility": "internal_answer", "question_id": "ncre-python-sample-q034", "document_id": "31a16a56-e947-505e-948a-a7075fd42ea0", "document_type": "sample_exam", "document_sha256": "a0f6a19967464aba6bbb5150d4311311672179c963f631eeed6745e7f4956fd8", "source_path": "python考试真题/二级Python语言程序设计——样题及参考答案.pdf", "source_title": "全国计算机等级考试（NCRE）二级 Python 语言程序设计 样题及参考答案", "exam_year": null, "question_number": 34, "section": "三、简单应用题", "question_type": "programming", "pdf_pages": [8], "topic_tags": ["turtle", "fd()", "seth()", "等边三角形", "绘图"], "difficulty": 3, "knowledge_node_ids": ["python.supplement.turtle_movement"], "knowledge_points": [{"id": "python.supplement.turtle_movement", "name": "turtle 移动与绝对朝向", "role": "assessed", "is_primary": true, "chapter_id": "python_tutorial.ch10", "chapter_title": "10. 标准库概览", "reference_section": "10", "reference_url": "https://docs.python.org/3/library/turtle.html#turtle.setheading", "is_supplementary": true}], "annotation_origin": "project_annotation", "review_status": "approved", "retrieval_ready": true, "revision": 2, "runtime_curriculum_eligible": false, "asset_paths": ["assets/source-page-8.png"], "answer_origin": "project_annotation", "source_correct_option": null, "correct_option": null, "source_text": null, "answer_pdf_pages": [], "assumptions": [], "references": ["https://docs.python.org/3/tutorial/stdlib.html", "https://docs.python.org/3/library/turtle.html#turtle.setheading", "https://docs.python.org/3/library/turtle.html#turtle.forward"]}}
{"id": "ncre-python-sample-q035:answer:v2", "text": "第35题内部参考答案：\n创建D后依次D['化学']=205、D['数学']=201、del D['生物']。\n\n```python\nD = {'数学': 101, '语文': 202, '英语': 203, '物理': 204, '生物': 206}\nD['化学'] = 205\nD['数学'] = 201\ndel D['生物']\n```\n\n解析：字典下标赋值可新增不存在的键或修改已有键；del删除指定键值对，pop('生物')也可以实现最后一步。", "metadata": {"visibility": "internal_answer", "question_id": "ncre-python-sample-q035", "document_id": "31a16a56-e947-505e-948a-a7075fd42ea0", "document_type": "sample_exam", "document_sha256": "a0f6a19967464aba6bbb5150d4311311672179c963f631eeed6745e7f4956fd8", "source_path": "python考试真题/二级Python语言程序设计——样题及参考答案.pdf", "source_title": "全国计算机等级考试（NCRE）二级 Python 语言程序设计 样题及参考答案", "exam_year": null, "question_number": 35, "section": "三、简单应用题", "question_type": "programming", "pdf_pages": [8], "topic_tags": ["字典", "创建", "添加键值对", "修改", "删除"], "difficulty": 2, "knowledge_node_ids": ["python.ch5.dictionary_operations"], "knowledge_points": [{"id": "python.ch5.dictionary_operations", "name": "字典创建与增删改", "role": "assessed", "is_primary": true, "chapter_id": "python_tutorial.ch05", "chapter_title": "5. 数据结构", "reference_section": "5.5", "reference_url": "https://docs.python.org/3/tutorial/datastructures.html#dictionaries", "is_supplementary": false}], "annotation_origin": "project_annotation", "review_status": "approved", "retrieval_ready": true, "revision": 2, "runtime_curriculum_eligible": false, "asset_paths": [], "answer_origin": "project_annotation", "source_correct_option": null, "correct_option": null, "source_text": null, "answer_pdf_pages": [], "assumptions": [], "references": ["https://docs.python.org/3/tutorial/datastructures.html#dictionaries", "https://docs.python.org/3/tutorial/datastructures.html#the-del-statement"]}}
{"id": "ncre-python-sample-q036:answer:v2", "text": "第36题内部参考答案：\n补充约定当前地球体重由用户输入；第year年地球体重w0+0.5*year，月球体重为其0.165倍，year取1至10。\n\n```python\nw0 = float(input('请输入当前地球体重（kg）：'))\nfor year in range(1, 11):\n    earth = w0 + 0.5 * year\n    moon = earth * 0.165\n    print(f'第{year}年：地球{earth:.2f}kg，月球{moon:.2f}kg')\n```\n\n解析：未来10年按第1到第10年处理，不包含当前第0年；年度地球体重先增加，再乘16.5%。原卷未给初始体重，输入是项目明确补充的解题约定。", "metadata": {"visibility": "internal_answer", "question_id": "ncre-python-sample-q036", "document_id": "31a16a56-e947-505e-948a-a7075fd42ea0", "document_type": "sample_exam", "document_sha256": "a0f6a19967464aba6bbb5150d4311311672179c963f631eeed6745e7f4956fd8", "source_path": "python考试真题/二级Python语言程序设计——样题及参考答案.pdf", "source_title": "全国计算机等级考试（NCRE）二级 Python 语言程序设计 样题及参考答案", "exam_year": null, "question_number": 36, "section": "四、综合应用题", "question_type": "programming", "pdf_pages": [8], "topic_tags": ["循环", "重量计算", "百分比", "年增长", "输入参数"], "difficulty": 3, "knowledge_node_ids": ["python.ch4.for_range", "python.ch3.arithmetic_expressions"], "knowledge_points": [{"id": "python.ch4.for_range", "name": "for 与 range()", "role": "assessed", "is_primary": true, "chapter_id": "python_tutorial.ch04", "chapter_title": "4. 更多控制流工具", "reference_section": "4.2,4.3", "reference_url": "https://docs.python.org/3/tutorial/controlflow.html#for-statements", "is_supplementary": false}, {"id": "python.ch3.arithmetic_expressions", "name": "算术表达式与公式转写", "role": "assessed", "is_primary": false, "chapter_id": "python_tutorial.ch03", "chapter_title": "3. Python 速览", "reference_section": "3.1.1", "reference_url": "https://docs.python.org/3/tutorial/introduction.html#numbers", "is_supplementary": false}], "annotation_origin": "project_annotation", "review_status": "approved", "retrieval_ready": true, "revision": 2, "runtime_curriculum_eligible": false, "asset_paths": [], "answer_origin": "project_annotation", "source_correct_option": null, "correct_option": null, "source_text": null, "answer_pdf_pages": [],